: {"collapsed": true}, "id": 12, "type": "MemoryCleaner", "title": "清理显存", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"clean_intensity": true, "unload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MemoryCleaner"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#1b4669", "widgets_values": ["【SAM3 扣人物视频 工作流】\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n使用步骤：\n① 加载视频：左侧 VHS_LoadVideo 上传/选择视频\n② SAM3模型：默认 sam3.pt，无需修改\n③ 提示词：默认 'person'，识别人物最稳定\n④ 点击 Queue Prompt 运行\n⑤ 查看预览，调整 obj_id 选择不同人物（1/2/3...）\n⑥ 输出视频自动保存为 mp4\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n常用调参：\n• obj_id：选择第几个人物（从1开始试）\n• invert_mask=True + grow=-5 + blur=3：\n  反转蒙版→背景涂黑，收缩5px去毛边，模糊3px过渡\n• color：DrawMaskOnImage 的颜色，'0,0,0'=黑底\n  改为 '0,255,0' 可做绿幕效果\n• 如需排除某个人物，可连接 negative_coords\n  格式：[{\"x\":300,\"y\":350}] (点在要排除的人物上)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n注意事项：\n• 视频越长显存占用越大，建议先用短视频测试\n• frame_load_cap 可限制加载帧数（0=全部）\n• 显存不足时可把 precision 从 fp16 改为 bf16"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "📋 使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#29556b", "size": [800, 350], "pos": [100, -250], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "mask", "links": [7], "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [2], "inputs": [{"name": "objects", "link": 6, "label": "objects", "type": "EASY_SAM3_OBJECTS_OUTPUT", "localized_name": "objects"}, {"widget": {"name": "obj_id"}, "name": "obj_id", "label": "obj_id", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "obj_id"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy sam3GetObjectMask", "title": "⑤提取人物蒙版(改obj_id选人 试1/2/3)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [330, 80], "pos": [1350, 350], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"obj_id": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy sam3GetObjectMask"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "mask", "links": [8], "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [true, -10, 3], "inputs": [{"name": "mask", "link": 7, "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "